{"id":2091,"date":"2026-08-26T00:45:07","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T00:45:07","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/?post_type=knowledgebase&#038;p=2091"},"modified":"2026-08-26T01:09:26","modified_gmt":"2026-08-26T01:09:26","slug":"multi-select-grouping-flip","status":"publish","type":"knowledgebase","link":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/db\/extra-tips\/multi-select-grouping-flip\/","title":{"rendered":"Multi-Select, Grouping &#038; Flip"},"content":{"rendered":"<div style=\"color: #2b2b2b;\">\n<h2 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Multi-Select, Grouping &amp; Flip<\/span><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2104\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MultiSelectAndGroupingAndFlip.webp\" alt=\"Multi-Select, Grouping &amp; Flip\" width=\"135\" height=\"142\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MultiSelectAndGroupingAndFlip.webp 902w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MultiSelectAndGroupingAndFlip-285x300.webp 285w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/MultiSelectAndGroupingAndFlip-768x808.webp 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 135px) 100vw, 135px\" \/><\/h2>\n<p class=\"western\">Open Publisher provides several ways to select and work with multiple elements at once,<br \/>\nas well as a quick gesture for mirroring any element without using a menu.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Selecting Multiple Elements<\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">There are three ways to select more than one element at a time:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2100\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectingMultipleElements.webp\" alt=\"Selecting Multiple Elements\" width=\"128\" height=\"123\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectingMultipleElements.webp 458w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/SelectingMultipleElements-300x288.webp 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/h3>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Marquee Selection &#8211;<\/strong> Click and drag on an empty area of the canvas to draw a selection rectangle. Any element whose bounds fall within the rectangle is selected automatically.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p align=\"left\"><span style=\"font-size: small;\"><strong>Ctrl+Click \/ Cmd+Click &#8211;<\/strong> Hold <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Ctrl<\/span> (Windows \/ Linux) or <span style=\"font-family: Courier New, monospace;\">Cmd<\/span> (Mac) and click additional elements to add them to the current selection one by one.<\/span><\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"western\">Once multiple elements are selected, you can move, resize, and delete them all at once.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">Flipping &amp; Mirroring<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2098\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FlippingAndMirroring.webp\" alt=\"Flipping &amp; Mirroring\" width=\"128\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FlippingAndMirroring.webp 425w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/FlippingAndMirroring-289x300.webp 289w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">To flip any element horizontally or vertically, drag one of its resize handles <em>past the element&#8217;s opposite edge<\/em>. Dragging past the left or right edge mirrors it horizontally; dragging past the top or bottom edge mirrors it vertically. No menu required &#8211; it happens naturally as part of the resize gesture.<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"western\"><span style=\"color: #007670;\">A Note on Grouping<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-2096\" src=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NoteOnGrouping.webp\" alt=\"A Note on Grouping\" width=\"128\" height=\"133\" srcset=\"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NoteOnGrouping.webp 425w, http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/NoteOnGrouping-290x300.webp 290w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px\" \/><\/span><\/h3>\n<p class=\"western\">The <strong>Group<\/strong> feature is currently unavailable and is greyed out in the menu. Use the multi-select methods above as a working alternative for managing several elements together.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Multi-Select, Grouping &amp; Flip Open Publisher provides several ways to select and work with multiple elements at once, as well as a quick gesture for mirroring any element without using a menu. Selecting Multiple Elements There are three ways to select more than one element at a time: Marquee Selection &#8211; Click and drag on [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":2104,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","template":"","knowledgebase_cat":[25],"class_list":["post-2091","knowledgebase","type-knowledgebase","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","knowledgebase_cat-extra-tips"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2091","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase"}],"about":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/knowledgebase"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2091"}],"version-history":[{"count":15,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2091\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":2113,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase\/2091\/revisions\/2113"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/2104"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2091"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"knowledgebase_cat","embeddable":true,"href":"http:\/\/acr.floydcraft.co.uk\/openpublisher\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/knowledgebase_cat?post=2091"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}